  - SE tax ≈ 3,944 × 0.9235 × 0.153 ≈ $557. Half ≈ $279 deduction.
Which is better depends on other home expenses you can allocate and the impact on net profit and SE tax. With the actual method using rent only, the home office deduction is larger (≈$4,176) and reduces taxable income more than simplified $500; however it reduces net profit so SE tax falls. Usually the actual method gives a larger deduction if you have a large rent amount (as here), but you must keep supporting documentation.

10) Records to gather
