- QBI (Qualified Business Income) deduction: you may be eligible for up to 20% of qualified business income from your web design business (Form 8995 or 8995‑A). With a small QBI (e.g., net business profit in the $3,900–$7,600 range depending on method) the QBI deduction would be modest (perhaps a few hundred dollars). Note: California does not allow the federal QBI deduction on the state return.
