- Schedule C — Profit or Loss from Business (report web design income and expenses; home office deduction on Schedule C).
- Schedule SE — Self-Employment Tax (to compute SE tax).
- Form 8995 (or 8995‑A) — Qualified Business Income Deduction (if you claim QBI; use Form 8995 for simpler cases).
