4) Practical next steps / checklist
- Clarify whether the $780 are self‑employment business expenses (if yes, put them on Schedule C).
- Gather forms: W‑2, any 1099‑NEC / 1099‑MISC, 1099‑INT / consolidated 1099 from broker, 1098‑E (student loan interest), receipts for charitable donation, rent records and utility bills (if you use actual home office method).
